# Mirror of the Lean WASM artifacts (run `npm run assets`). ~127 MB, fetched
# from a third-party deploy, and not ours to redistribute in git.
public/lean-wasm/

# Mirror of the optional per-file libraries (run `npm run assets:libs`).
# ~377 MB for Std + Lean + Batteries, including the lean-lib-files.json index.
public/lean-lib/

# Mirror of the Mathlib layer (run `npm run assets:mathlib`). ~316 MB compressed.
public/lean-mathlib/

# The single-threaded build's work area (`wasm-build/README.md`): the pinned fork, the cmake build tree
# and the artifacts come out of it, several GB of it. Committed to git are the recipe, not the result.
wasm-build/cache/
wasm-build/out/
wasm-build/*.log
